    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "Mosaic Ventures invests in AI-driven startups at Seed and Series A, offering hands-on support for European entrepreneurs to scale globally with a thesis-driven, boutique approach. Today, we partner with the continent’s leading AI entrepreneurs, and help them scale globally – especially across the Atlantic. Artificial intelligence is transforming the world economy, and is the greatest technology shift of our lifetimes. We back outlier founders and management teams with unique insight, building in the AI application layer. We are a small partnership with no siloes, leading or co-leading a small number of investments per year. With decades of operating and investing experience, we bring a Silicon Valley mindset to back future category leaders with European roots. We roll up our sleeves to work closely alongside the management team, offering long-term counsel at pivotal moments.",
