    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "The community powered VC of the New Nordics. byFounders was built by a collective of founders who want to help the next generation of ambitious founders emerging from the New Nordics. Invite us on board as your first investor, and we will be your trusted ally. This is when we can add the most value, and it's something we've done many times before with companies like Lovable, Verda, Sumary, Safetywing, Bob W, Parahelp, Corti, and many, many more. We will encourage, challenge, push, open doors, and serve as your sounding board. Day and night. As a generalist tech fund, we don't hold a sector thesis. We go where the talent is, and we invest in people before ideas. What we're after is the history and the drive that explain why you keep going when things get tough. That's why we'd rather spend time on the hardest things you've been through than overanalyzing market sizing. Being early also means being genuinely on the same side, so we don't stack the term sheet in our favor with a bunch of protective clauses. We sit in the same share class as you, so there's no version of the outcome where our interests and yours point in different directions. Our full term sheet is public, and we encourage you to read it to understand our approach. Remember, it's never too early to start a conversation with us — though it can definitely be too late. Reach out, and let's start building our relationship. Occasionally, when it makes sense. If another investor's competencies and network complement ou",
