    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "We are Germany’s most active VC investor, funding deep-tech, life sciences and digital tech companies that secure technological sovereignty and build industrial strength. Some of Germany’s most innovative companies started with us – and grew with us. Our team combines in-depth tech expertise, startup experience and a wealth of know-how in early-stage investing with a unique network: always with an eye on the technologies of tomorrow and sustainable solutions. We invest in these three areas: The sweet spot of our initial investments in pre-seed and seed is €800,000+. We invest flexibly – depending on your needs. As a lead investor, we work with many partners: we will find suitable co-investors for you from our national and international network. In growth rounds, we can invest up to €30 million in a startup from our portfolio. We will support you from the beginning all the way to the exit or IPO – on the path to becoming an international market leader. Your startup is headquartered in Germany or – in the case of start-ups from other countries – has a German base of operations. Your startup should be active in the fields of digital tech, industrial tech, life sciences, chemistry or related business areas.",
