    excerpt: "Innovation Endeavors is an early-stage venture capital firm built for founders reimagining the technical frontier. From chips to developer tools, the foundational layers of modern computing are being rebuilt to power what's next. Biology, computation, and engineering are converging to change how we understand and improve human health. Most of GDP still runs on atoms, yet most of these industries remain underserved by technology. Intelligent, AI-native software is rewriting how complex industries operate from the ground up. Atom Computing is building large-scale quantum computers to expand what’s computationally possible for researchers and enterprises. Inception Labs builds diffusion language models designed for ultra-low latency, enabling a new class of real-time, interactive AI products. Planet Labs operates a global fleet of Earth-imaging satellites that deliver frequent, near real-time data to help organizations monitor changes at scale. AlphaSense builds an AI-powered market intelligence platform that helps business and finance teams make faster, more informed decisions Eikon Therapeutics is developing a new approach to drug discovery that combines advanced microscopy and computation to directly observe molecular interactions, enabling faster and more precise development of new therapies. Uber operates a global software and data platform that has reshaped urban transportation and on-demand logistics at scale. Companies Approach Team Insights Camp Terms of Service 1845 El",
