    excerpt: "Salesforce Ventures helps enterprising founders build companies that reinvent the way the world works. What We Do Since our founding in 2009, enterprise technology has been our sole focus. We’ve invested in more than 630 startups, deployed $6B+ in capital, and guided over 200 companies to IPOs and acquisitions. We provide networking opportunities, early product feedback, strategic partnerships, and customer introductions through connections with key decision makers and technical leaders at Fortune 500 companies, including a deep partnership with Salesforce, so you can get to market faster. We offer customized mentorship, hands-on assistance, and domain-specific insights from enterprise leaders and active Salesforce executives so you can drive measurable growth faster. When you partner with Salesforce Ventures, you become a member of one of the world’s strongest communities of startups and can partner with Salesforce’s specialized platforms to generate visibility and advance your solutions. We believe values drive value. We offer patient capital, enabling you to grow with a foundation of trust, transparency, and meaningful impact. by Paul Drews Insights 15 Years of Salesforce Ventures Our report on the past, present, and future of Salesforce Ventures. by Salesforce Ventures News Why Founders Choose Salesforce Ventures: In Their Own Words Meet the visionary founders shaping tomorrow — and how Salesforce Ventures helps bring their ideas to life.",
