    excerpt: "We are a global growth equity fund focused on technology investments. Atlantic Bridge portfolio company SambaNova has raised $1 billion in the first close of its Series F round, valuing the AI infrastructure company at $11 billion. Office Hours is a platform to meet the Atlantic Bridge team, get a second opinion and build a relationship. The format of the meeting is a 20 minute call with a member of the team. We’re open to giving advice, getting pitched to or just having a chat. Atlantic Bridge is a Global Growth Equity Technology Firm with over €1 billion of",
