    excerpt: "For founders Portfolio People News Let's talk Investor login The first round partner for category-changing companies We help exceptional Nordic founders build thriving global companies. From day 0 through every step of the way. IQM Series A+ Quantum IXI Series A+ Consumer Ever CARS Series A+ AI Distance Seed AI Enfuce Series A+ Fintech Riff Series A+ AI Strise Series A+ AI We invest in Our sweet spot is partnering from Day 0, investing in first rounds (<€5M), and supporting founders every step of the way. “Building a global quantum computing company requires investors who expand horizons beyond the state of the art. Maki.vc has consistently shown the boldness and long-term vision needed to support our innovation at this scale. Their investment is more than capital – it is a strong vote of confidence in our technology, our team, and our mission to build one of the world’s leading quantum computing companies from Europe.” Maki is the definitive deep tech partner for startups in the Nordics. Truly a partner, not just an investor. Together as one team when needed. We didn’t have a CFO and had to close the books. Help? Got it. Need market research? With Maki, you’re truly tapping into a world-class team, not dumb money. “Maki is capable of bold bets and understands the deepest of tech. That’s exactly what you want in your first investors.” “Maki didn’t just back our vision – they backed us as founders. From our first check through every subsequent round, they’ve helped us",
