    excerpt: "JMI Equity brings 35 years of growth investing, operator expertise, and true partnership. About Partnership Team Companies News & Insights LP Login (Link opens in new window) Scaling market leading AI-driven software businesses. EdSights Vantaca Parachute Health SewerAI First Due ServiceNow $ 1 2 B + Committed Capital 2 0 0 + Investments 3 5 Years of Consistent Strategy A preferred partner and investor in AI-driven software companies. JMI invests exclusively in AI-driven software companies. We build partnerships grounded in the realities of each individual business, and work closely with management teams to improve product, drive customer satisfaction, and expand market share to drive growth. Decades of experience and pattern recognition to help you accelerate growth and avoid mistakes. Applying AI across functions to drive better customer outcomes and greater operational efficiency. Invest across the growth stage, $20M minority stakes to $500M majority buyouts. Agnostic to check size, structure, and deal type. Spanning over 200 software company investments across more than 30 focus areas, our portfolio demonstrates deep domain authority and is a strategic edge for driving growth Comprehensive learning ecosystem connecting portfolio company executives through peer-to-peer knowledge sharing, expert-led sessions, and collaborative problem-solving initiatives. The current and former portfolio companies highlighted on this pag",
    note: "",
    logo: "/logos/jmi.png",
    synthetic: false,
    confirmed: false,
    currency: "GBP",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "About Partnership Team Companies News & Insights LP Login (Link opens in new window) About We've been investing in software businesses since 1992. We believe enduring success comes from shared vision and conviction, not rigid playbooks, a consistent point of view, applied with discipline, for over three decades. We started investing in the client-server era, were at the forefront of the transition to cloud, and now AI, backing the incumbents that adapt and the native challengers that force them to. We invest flexibly across the growth stage, in size, structure, and deal type, always looking for strong businesses with enduring customer value where we can be meaningful partners in the next stage of growth. Flexible investment approach across the growth stage, from $20M minority stakes to $500M majority buyouts. Harry Gruner and Charlie Noell founded JMI Equity to invest exclusively in software. John Moores, the founder of BMC Software, was the initial Limited Partner. Co-led one of the largest growth investments in legal tech history to help scale a category-defining practice management platform globally."}],

