    summary: "Build reliable background jobs, workflows, and AI agents without extra infrastructure. Automatic retries, flow control, and step-level observability. AI Workflows & Agents Build AI agents with Inngest Webhooks & Events Inngest events from any source, reliably Background Jobs Learn about background jobs Crons & Scheduled Jobs Learn about scheduled and recurring jobs Instantly Durable AI Code. Use functions to checkpoint and offload without extra infrastructure. Inngest is the fastest way to orchestrate all your async code. Wrap functions in steps to handle any event, at any scale. Pause, fan-out, defer, retry, and A/B test—one SDK, zero infra. However it’s written, wherever it runs, Inngest makes it unbreakable. Start locally, scale instantly. Copy prompt to start locally Copied Start free in cloud Everything queues can’t do; everything you don’t want to do. Observability No more bespoke instrumentation. Inngest executes your functions, so you get observability by default. Trace every background job, agent, and event from trigger to completion, and use that data to evaluate outcomes on real production traffic. Basic queues don't know what to do when multiple users compete for the same resource. Noisy neighbors, hand-rolled rate limits, wasted compute… Inngest’s flow control ensures every user gets their fair share, without extra work. Sandboxes need durability too. Try a change without putting production traffic behind it. Run a new prompt, model, or code path in an isolated s",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.inngest.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "AI Workflows & Agents Build AI agents with Inngest Webhooks & Events Inngest events from any source, reliably Background Jobs Learn about background jobs Crons & Scheduled Jobs Learn about scheduled and recurring jobs Instantly Durable AI Code. Use functions to checkpoint and offload without extra infrastructure. Engineers spend half their time on the code that propels their apps forward, and half their time just keeping that code from failing. So in 2022, we released a new way to build and optimize event-driven workflows without leaving your codebase. Inngest is open core and can be run on any developer's laptop or on Inngest Cloud, using any compute platform. We’re mostly a team of grizzled engineers who have no desire to return to a world of hand-rolled queues, manual retry logic, and full architecture rebuilds when the “right” way to build something changes. We also have a few marketers and sellers who don’t really understand but bet that was really hard 🤍 We're a small, remote-first team that are passionate about delivering great products. We all work closely with customers to deliver the right solution that solves many use cases, not on-off features"}],

