    logo: "/logos/captions.png",
    stage: "Seed",
    round: null,
    summary: "Captions is an AI video generator and editor that makes it easy to go from idea to ready-to-share content. Get great videos every time, no matter your skillset. Skip post-production entirely. Captions' AI editing transforms footage into a fully edited video that's ready to share. Captions edits with taste, not just speed. Our AI understands your story and tailors edits to your specific footage. You have control if you want to change details. Never edited before? No problem. Make advanced edits with simple prompts using the chat-based editor. Watch as AI edits your entire video at once. Pick a style , and Captions automatically cuts scenes, overlays B-roll and more. You can also use Captions to auto-generate captions or translated subtitles . Make an AI twin or choose from digital avatars . Iterate fast, using the same avatar for different topics and videos. Use prompts to change their outfits, backgrounds or even product inserts. It’s free to sign up for Captions, but you’ll want a subscription to access the best features. Explore our plans to pick the right one for you. Captions is an AI video editor that produces fully-edited videos. You can upload existing footage and use easy AI editing tools to finish the project. You can also use Captions to generate entirely new footage, without having to record on your own. Captions guides you through suggested edits with its AI editor, empowering you to make any video you want, regardless of expertise. You can use Captions on your ph",
    person: null,
