    round: null,
    summary: "An extensible developer-friendly application security platform that scans source code to surface true and actionable security issues with AI-assisted SAST, SCA, and Secrets Detection solutions. Semgrep Guardian is live. Scan AI-generated code the moment it’s written. Free for 30 days. Learn More Empower agents with tools and context required to automate threat detection, triage, and remediation. An analysis of code security remediation patterns across tens of thousands of actively developed repositories. Learn how Semgrep improves accuracy, saves time, and delivers a superior developer experience. Mythos is poised to give attackers an unprecedented advantage, but Semgrep can help you restore the balance in your favor. Build at the pace your agents write code. Semgrep gives every agent in your workflow the tools and context to secure code at agentic speed. Lives where developers work, delivering fixes without breaking flow. Gives security teams visibility, control, and confidence. AppSec teams triage 80% fewer false positives across SAST and SCA. Backlogs shrink, and engineering velocity climbs. AI learns your code context to eliminate false positives and prioritize reachable vulnerabilities – validated by 95% of security reviewers across 6M+ findings. 24/7 on-call security monitoring triggers an incident scan within 30 minutes of discovery. Teams get notified by Semgrep and can see the latest malware findings on their dashboard or via API. Enterprise-grade policies, with Slac",
