    round: null,
    summary: "Bring AI-native applications to life with less hallucination, data leakage, and vendor lock-in Store, index, and search high-dimensional vectors at any scale. The foundation for search, RAG, and agents. Ask questions in natural language. Query Agent translates intent into optimized database queries automatically. Built-in vector generation from text, images, and more. No external embedding pipeline required. With over 20M open source downloads and thousands of customers, Weaviate is a core piece of the stack for leading startups, scale-ups, and enterprises. “ I need peace of mind. When we are scaling our systems, I don't want to worry about scalability and uptime of our vector database as it serves as a core foundation supporting all our services. ” “ Weaviate stood out as it’s clearly built for production use, not just testing. It was the only solution with an efficient tenant system that scaled to our workload of tens of thousands of segmented indexes. ” “ Many large banks focus on quick AI wins but there’s a big opportunity to reinvent research workflows from start to finish in an AI-native way. ” “ Before MarvelX, I implemented Weaviate in banking where security was really important. Being able to have trust in something battle-tested is very important. ” “ Accuracy — how good the answer is — is the first thing we want to optimize for. That’s how we found Weaviate. ” Spin up a cluster, point it at your data, and go. Weaviate can take care of embeddings, ranking, and auto-",
