    round: null,
    summary: "Run open-source machine learning models with a cloud API Seedream 5.0 lite is ByteDance's image model with built-in reasoning, example-based editing, and deep domain knowledge. Google's fast image generation model with conversational editing, multi-image fusion, and character consistency OpenAI's latest image generation model with better instruction following and adherence to prompts Recraft V4 Styles Pro SVG generates high-quality editable vector images that match a reusable style or attached reference images. Recraft's latest image generation model at ~2048px resolution. Same design taste and prompt accuracy as V4, with higher resolution for print-ready and large-scale work. OpenAI's image generation and editing model. Create and edit images from text with close instruction following, sharp text rendering, and detailed edits. AI shouldn’t be locked up inside academic papers and demos. Make it real by pushing it to Replicate. Anthropic's model for the most demanding reasoning and long-horizon agentic work, at 20% less per token than Fable 5 OpenAI's fast image model for generating and editing images from text and image inputs. Adds a complexity setting that controls how much the model plans before it renders. Generate videos with MiniMax H3 Lite, the lower-cost version of MiniMax H3. Supports text-to-video, first- and last-frame image-to-video, and reference-based video generation at 480P or 768P. Generate videos with MiniMax H3 Highspeed, a faster version of MiniMax H3 that",
