    round: null,
    summary: "LaunchDarkly helps teams safely manage code and AI agents in production with feature flags, progressive delivery, automated rollback, and runtime control. Feature flags Release Autopilot Observability Experimentation Agent integrations Integrations Architecture Solutions By Use Case Control AI agents Optimize AI performance & cost Self-heal systems Run experiments By Team Power analysis calculator Flagship engineering blog Community Take control of your code and agents at runtime. By supplying my contact information, I authorize LaunchDarkly to contact me with personalized marketing communications about our products and services. See our Privacy Policy for more details, or Opt-Out at any time. Trends Model Distribution last 7d GPT-6.1 Terra 55% Claude Fable 5.1 29% Claude Sonnet 5.5 10% GPT-6.1 Sol 6% Agent Control Financial Analyst Agent All variations ⌄ 1 Tool Avg. Satisfaction 91 x last 7d Releases that run themselves. Automate flagging, rollouts, rollbacks, and cleanup for every change—with no extra work for your team. Your AI software factory control center. This resource center is for teams looking to build and run an AI software factory that automates the entire SDLC. Control every change in production. 01 02 03 04 05 Ship AI-built code with confidence. Progressively release changes and roll back instantly based on real-time impact. Control and govern AI agents in production. Automatically keep agents on track, mitigating bad behavior and steering responses in real tim",
