    summary: "Run payments, manage your data, and offer financial products in one platform. Adyen is purpose-built for the world Adyen Logo Products Businesses we serve About Resources Pricing Contact us Contact us THE STATE OF SMB PAYMENTS 2026 GET THE INSIGHTS Fintech built for the long run One platform for payments, data, and financial products. Built to scale with the world's leading businesses. Run your business with confidence. Adyen delivers the control, reliability, and expertise global enterprises depend on. Value Proposition Gallery Compliance you can trust Drive revenue with optimized payments and automated payouts. Accept, settle, and move funds on one platform. Launch payments and financial products under your brand Unlock new revenue streams. Embed payments, accounts, card issuing, and capital with a single integration. Use cases Accept payments Send payouts globally In person payments Adyen for Platforms Intelligent Money Movement Adyen for Platforms 1 2 Different industries. One standard. Businesses across sectors trust Adyen to keep money moving. Retail Offer faster checkouts, stronger security, and better customer experiences across channels. Travel and hospitality Digital media and content SaaS platforms and marketplaces Food and beverage Financial services Global scale. Local expertise. Powered by trillions of euros in transaction data. Processed annually €1.4T",
