    summary: "Plaid helps all companies build fintech solutions by making it easy, safe and reliable for people to connect their financial data to apps and services. When you build on the world's largest financial data network, your products get smarter with every connection—helping you increase conversion, expand access, and grow faster. Previous items Next items Start building better financial products Let's get started First name Last name Company email Company name Country Phone number (optional) By submitting this form, I confirm that I have read and understood Plaid's Privacy Statement . When you connect to an app with Plaid, you're in control of who has access to your financial data.",
