    summary: "Help your business go further with the UK's no.1 platform for small business loans & finance. Borrow up to £750k and get a decision in as little as 5 minutes. As proud sponsors of Prem Rugby , we believe in the power of a good team behind you. That's why we're here to back businesses all over the UK with the finance they need to succeed. Our products are designed to fit the needs of business owners, and come with decisions in as little as 5 minutes. Business credit cards Use FlexiPay to split costs over 1-12 instalments, or get market-leading rewards with our Cashback credit card.",
