    summary: "UK payroll software with managed payroll services to help you stay HMRC compliant. Automate payslips, HMRC submissions and reporting with expert support. The first AI agent dedicated to payroll and HR, supporting you 24/7 with reliable, personalized answers. “I can pull a lot more data much more easily now. I can put data up in front of the Exec, and it's made a real difference. Plus, the level of customer service we get from Payfit is amazing.” A dedicated team of UK payroll experts, compliant payroll support and Payfit AI help you stay one step ahead. Manage payroll, HR and your people from one connected platform. \"Compliance and regulatory calculations happening behind the scenes give us confidence that whatever our finance team does is backed up.” Luke Mackey, CEO and Co-founder Kota, 80+ employees THE WINNING TRIO UK payroll experts. Payfit AI. One connected platform. Payroll managed by experts Dedicated UK payroll expert for your account We take legal responsibility for your payroll and apply all regulatory changes in real time. Whether switching from another solution or running payroll for the first time, they all chose Payfit for the same reasons. Making faster decisions, saving time, and staying focused on what mattered most for their teams. They wanted to stay focused Less time spent on payroll and HR admin meant more time to focus on growing their business. Approving a last-minute leave at 6 pm? Adding a new starter the evening before payday? Ask Payfit AI: it hand",
