    logo: "/logos/tldv.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "tl;dv is the AI notetaker and AI meeting assistant for Zoom, Google Meet and Teams. Transcripts, summaries and CRM updates from every call. Free forever. The AI notetaker that captures every conversation and turns it into the work that should follow. Get tl;dv - Free forever Book a Demo SOC 2 GDPR No AI training AI Act compliant Captures any meeting MCP CRM Autofill Email Draft 9:41 Lunch with Jack In-person meeting 00:00:09 Pause Stop AI Notes Transcript Ask AI Dashboards Action Items We're a mid-sized marketing agency, and lately we've been struggling to streamline our project management. Centralized communication, task assignment and deadline tracking, plus reports for our clients. That's exactly where tl;dv helps. It records every client call, writes the notes and action items, and sends them to your project tool, so nobody has to type up a recap again. Most come from mid-market deals in evaluation, usually right after the pricing demo. Reps who share the security pack before the demo close these objections about a week faster, and deals that reach a CRM migration plan in the first call rarely stall. 9:41 Lunch with Jack In-person meeting 00:00:09 Pause Stop Weekly Review 3.00pm - 4:15pm What objections came up most this quarter? Sonnet 5.5 High CRM Autofill Database Autofill Email Drafter +5000 Dashboards AI Notes Ask AI Transcript Action Items Follow up with marketing on campaign Clarify ownership of customer onboarding Send revised pricing proposal to client Gather fee",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://tldv.io/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "These three tech enthusiasts had years of collaborative product experience behind them and knew exactly how to address this. Today, more than 3 million users rely on tl;dv every day: sales teams, customer success organizations, consulting firms, and any team where meeting knowledge is a critical asset. Every meeting captured automatically without anyone having to remember to press record. Custom templates run your playbook on every single call: MEDDIC, SPIN, SPICE, or whatever your team has built. Intelligence across hundreds of calls, not one at a time. Ask one question, get an answer drawn from every conversation your team has ever had. EU data stays in the EU, processed on EU servers."}],

