    logo: "/logos/gorgias.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Provide multichannel customer service from a single app. Gain productivity with automated responses to common requests. With the help of investors, accelerators, and mentors, Gorgias has quickly grown to more than 400 team members across the globe. Today, we serve over 16,400 merchants, including renowned brands like Steve Madden, Glossier, and BruMate. Beyond becoming a fast-growing customer service platform, Gorgias is a certified B Corporation and has become a leader in sustainable and equitable workplace practices. As we continue to grow, Gorgias commits to transforming the customer experience with complete transparency, ownership, and maximum impact",
    person: null,
