    round: null,
    summary: "18,000+ organizations trust Algolia to build intuitive, adaptive, high-performing experiences with a unified AI search & retrieval platform spanning agentic, generative, and search. English German French Brazilian Portuguese Spanish Italian Webinar: Introducing Algolia's native Shopify B2B integration Watch now News: Orange Group deploys Algolia AI agents Read more Company Partners Support Login Logout Algolia mark white Algolia logo white CLOSE Products Try Algolia on your own data Get started Developer Hub Developer Hub Documentation Documentation Integrations Integrations UI Components UI Components Autocomplete Autocomplete Resources Code Exchange Code Exchange Engineering Blog Engineering Blog MCP MCP Discord Discord Webinars & Events Webinars & Events Quick Links Quick Start Guide Quick Start Guide For Open Source For Open Source API Status API Status Support Support Resources Ready to unlock the benefits of agentic AI? Algolia Assist Schedule a call Sign up today How can I help you today? I search through your content to help you find answers to your questions, fast. More than 18,000 customers across 150+ countries use Algolia to power agentic, generative, and search experiences across these use cases and more. Customers can use natural language in the search bar and AI recognizes intent to guide their discovery. Learn more . Ensure every AI response is accurate and on-brand with RAG that grounds outputs in your verified data and stays consistent with your search logic",
