    round: null,
    summary: "Built for scale with enterprise-grade reliability and performance. For enterprises 300M+ For startups Lovable builds its AI-native coding platform and developer experience on top of Mintlify. Learn how Replit uses Mintlify to turn documentation into a fast, collaborative, and accessible experience. Yes. Use Mintlify for product guides, tutorials, onboarding, help centers, and knowledge bases as well as API references. You do not need an OpenAPI specification. Built-in version and language navigation lets readers switch between releases or translated pages you maintain in Git. Publishing your own translations is separate from paid AI translation. Write pages in Markdown or MDX, or use the browser editor. Product, support, and documentation teams can write and edit in the browser while engineers continue working locally. The web editor supports real-time collaboration, comments, and suggestions. Publishing commits changes to Git, and feature branches let teams review changes before they reach the live site. The web editor is included in the Free plan. Self-hosting is available on Enterprise through a scoped deployment with the Mintlify team. You can run Mintlify in your own cloud or on-premises environment on AWS or a Kubernetes platform, including Azure and Google Cloud. Your team operates the infrastructure, and Mintlify provides application releases and support. Th",
