    round: null,
    summary: "Our automated tax compliance software helps your business streamline sales tax reporting and filing. Il semble que vous préfériez notre site France (Français) . Souhaitez-vous y accéder pour du contenu et des tarifs localisés ? Sie bevorzugen vermutlich unsere Website Deutschland (Deutsch) . Möchten Sie zu lokalen Inhalten und Preisen wechseln? Sembra che tu preferisca il nostro sito Italia (Italiano) . Vuoi passare a contenuti e prezzi locali? Parece que prefieres nuestro sitio España (Español) . ¿Quieres cambiar para ver contenido y precios locales? It looks like you might prefer our United Kingdom (English) site. Would you like to switch for localized content and pricing? Discover Avalara Aviator, the agent hub that brings purpose-built AI agents into your tax and compliance workflows.→ Introducing Avalara Aviator, the agent hub where AI agents execute tax and compliance work with audit-ready accuracy. Avalara AI agents are trained on billions of real-world transactions, proprietary research, and continuously updated content across 60,000+ data sources. Powered by ALFA — our AI foundry built on 40+ leading models — every calculation, classification, and filing is deterministic and grounded in verified tax expertise. AI agents observe, advise, and execute — inside the ERPs, billing platforms, and other business systems where compliance actually happens. Imagine an AI-powered digital compliance team that works 24/7 and simplif",
