    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "See how 250+ Botkeeper firms are saving time & increasing profit with the only badass bookkeeping solution designed for badass accounting pros. We’re all about creating maximum capacity through AI—automating what used to eat up hours, and layering in dedicated services when you need extra hands. Why? Because with real capacity, your firm can scale faster, serve better, expand offerings, outpace the competition, or just focus on the work you love. Secure & Consistent SOC2 Type 2 compliance, bank-grade security and skilled accountants ensure the books are always safely managed. A Whole New Level of ROI Realize tremendous savings and scalability with automation instead of manual data entry. We scale with your firm, and cost less per client over time. Frictionless Online Signup No one likes jumping through hoops. With our new, online frictionless signup, you can jump in and reap the benefits of Botkeeper Infinite faster than ever. Unmatched Support Our success is YOUR success in the most literal sense. With support levels to match your commitment, Botkeeper also offers the flexibility of support upgrades to suit your firm's needs. Proven Process The Botkeeper Proven Process is the recipe we've used for over 200 Accounting firms and their 5000+ business clients. Our firms have saved countless hours, generated millions in new revenue, and experienced a better quality of work-life balance. Purpose-built for Firms Every part of our solution has been specifically designed to be \"Accou",
