    website: "https://www.marshmallow.com/",
    logo: "/logos/marshmallow.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Get car, van and home insurance from Marshmallow. Fair prices, fast quotes, no jargon. Get a quote in minutes and see what you could save. Car insurance Home insurance Car finance About us Help & Guides Get a quote Make a claim Car insurance Home insurance Car finance About us Help & Guides Claims Get a quote Products We combine competitive prices with a quick set up, a 24/7 claims line and innovative features on our highly rated app. Explore more products Telematics insurance Get our best price with Marshmallow Move. Quick to install and easy to set up. Our team will contact you with any updates on your claim. If you want to contact us, start a live chat in the app or on our Help page . If you want to contact us, call the team 01908 302323. Start a live chat in the app or on our Help page , or search for the information you need. Yes you can get both car insurance and home insurance with Marshmallow. Simply apply for one product, then you can add the second. We make it easy in the app, and you can manage both policies side by side. Yes, we work with a panel of car dealerships to help people get a loan for their car. Find out more about how it works on our Car finance page . No. Although we’re proud to help people from around the world get a better deal on their car insurance, we do the same for people born in the UK too. Learn how UK car insurance groups work, which are the cheapest groups and how to check which group",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.marshmallow.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Car insurance Home insurance Car finance About us Help & Guides Get a quote Make a claim Car insurance Home insurance Car finance About us Help & Guides Claims Get a quote Products Our story From our humble beginnings to one of the UK's fastest growing scale-ups. People who moved to the UK were being charged more for car insurance, just because their driving experience was from abroad. With no UK credit history, the same was true for credit cards, loans, bank accounts and more. Now, nearly 10 years later, we've hepled over a million drivers save on their insurance. From Liverpool to Lagos, and Birmingham to Bangalore, we’re always learning about their needs and what we can do to improve their experience with us. Marshmallow is founded by twins Alexander and Oliver Kent-Braham and David Goate. Working out of a gym lobby to save costs, they start trying to reduce the cost of car insurance for people that move to the UK. Marshmallow becomes a licensed insurance carrier so we can underwrite our own policies, and we achieve unicorn status after a valuation of $1 billion"}],

