    round: null,
    summary: "Iterable is an AI customer engagement platform built for how customers behave today, helping brands respond in real time with unified data and optimization. Most platforms react. Iterable adapts intelligently and in real time . Iterable is the AI customer engagement platform global brands trust to create experiences that drive growth across every channel. In the AI Era, customers don’t follow linear journeys – they move quickly between channels, devices, and moments of intent. Iterable helps thousands of marketing teams respond in real time, with a platform that learns, adapts, and improves every interaction. Real-time AI decisioning powered by customer behavior, context, and performance signals, so every message gets smarter over time. Unify behavioral, product, and engagement data so every experience reflects what a customer actually cares about in the moment. Enterprise grade performance, reliability, and security, trusted by global brands running trillions of customer interactions. Iterable combines powerful technology with the expertise and partnership teams need to create better Respond to customer intent with real-time, relevant experiences that strengthen engagement, retention, and loyalty.",
