    summary: "Run AI products in production with a unified stack for agents, inference, and cloud—built for control, performance, and economics at scale. Workato runs 1T+ automation tasks on DigitalOcean’s Inference Engine at 67% lower cost — with 67% higher throughput on the same workload. RadixArk, the team behind open-source inference engine SGLang, runs all 1.6T parameters of DeepSeek V4 Pro on DigitalOcean and tuned it to 10x throughput. Hippocratic AI runs healthcare agents on DigitalOcean, powering 20M+ patient interactions with 40% lower end-to-end P99 latency and 2× higher throughput. Built for agents. Open at every layer. From agent runtimes to inference to GPUs, every layer is purpose-built for AI and integrated end-to-end. Most providers only offer one or two services, or bury them among 300 disconnected services. Managed Agents Learning Services Data Services Inference Engine Core Cloud Infrastructure Managed Agents # Production agents that run on the same stack as your data, inference, and infrastructure. No cross-vendor hops. No lost context. No separate tool platform to build. Open agents and tools: Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, LangGraph, Hermes, CrewAI, and MCP. Learning Services # Three products that work as one self-improving loop. Insights records what an agent does, Signals flags where it falls short, Evaluations tests changes. The evidence they produce is what teams use to optimize an agent. Data Services # Resilient, high performance databases across agentic, ve",
