    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Lightning-fast search and AI retrieval, trusted by 20,000+ teams. Fully managed on Meilisearch Cloud, or self-host the open source engine. Product Solutions Developers Pricing Blog 59.9k Get started Request a demo One platform to build, scale, and unify search and AI retrieval Simplifying how teams build with search. Boost my search with AI Red One 2024 Kraven the Hunter 2024 Sonic the Hedgehog 3 2024 Amaran 2024 Alarum 2025 Star Trek: Section 31 2025 Mufasa: The Lion King 2024 Venom: The Last Dance 2024 8 results in 3 ms Get started Request custom demo Trusted by leading industry innovators The next generation of search Meilisearch is a flexible and powerful user-focused search engine that can be added to any website or application. Search-as-you-type returns answers in less than 50 milliseconds. That's faster than the blink of an eye! Deploy in a matter of minutes. Smart presets let you start searching through your data with zero configuration. Take advantage of the most advanced full-text search engine with its out-of-the-box great relevancy that fits every use case. Apps & sites Leverage a unified information retrieval platform with AI-powered hybrid search. Deliver fast, relevant results out-of-the-box across private or public data, in apps or websites. Boost conversion rates with lightning-fast semantic and hybrid search. Surface the right products in under 50 ms and turn discovery into higher online sales. Revolutionize media discovery with an all-in-one AI search and",
