    id: "tines",
    name: "Tines",
    website: "https://www.tines.com/",
    logo: "/logos/tines.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Apps, agents and automations, in the complete environment for enterprise AI. Databricks Reddit Snowflake Dropbox Pinterest MongoDB Sophos Canva McKesson Coinbase Databricks Reddit Snowflake Dropbox Pinterest MongoDB Sophos Canva McKesson Book a demo Sign up free Your workspace 0:00 / 2:23 Let them build it Give teams the freedom to create the agents, apps and automations they wish existed, and the safe place to put them to work. From first idea to dependable software, there’s one complete environment for enterprise AI. Ideas are only the beginning. Tines is the complete environment to turn them into software the business can build, deploy and operationalize. Put AI to work without giving it the keys. Secure credentials, isolated execution and IT-defined permissions keep the business in control. More builders shouldn’t mean more blind spots. Know what’s running, who’s responsible and where the value is. Tines monitors running software, identifies problems and proposes tested fixes and improvements. You decide which changes go live. Choose the models, tools and infrastructure that work for your enterprise. Own your code and the freedom to change it. Tines helps us spend less time on manual work and more time serving the business. Lloyd Cilliers Head of IT Tines is helping Headspace move beyond AI experimentation and into real adoption. Chris Oh Senior Director of AI Enablement One safe place for every team to build Tines lets every team build. IT and Security maintain complete",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.tines.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "We believe that by combining AI, automation, and integration with human ingenuity organizations are more efficient, secure, and will have more engaged, happier teams. Before Tines, our founders, Eoin and Thomas , spent more than a decade as senior security operators, experiencing all of the usual pain points felt within and beyond security teams: too much work; not enough staff; inevitable incidents. They knew there needed to be a laser-focused solution, so in 2018 they started building Tines. Backed by the best Accel Addition Blossom Felicis Index Ventures Our values We strive for our product, processes, and customer interactions to be as simple, straightforward, and understandable as possible. In everything we do, we try to remove the unnecessary barriers and friction, focusing on the most important and impactful work. We are quick to ship, to respond, and to act. Speed is critical, however, it’s irrelevant if applied in a haphazard way. We must take ownership, execute with purpose, collect feedback, and iterate. We’re determined to achieve our mission and goals, but we want to be proud of HOW we achieve them."}],

