    name: "Peloton",
    website: "https://www.onepeloton.com/",
    logo: "/logos/peloton.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Discover Peloton’s fitness equipment and personalized workout plans. From cardio to strength, find an exercise program that keeps you motivated and on track. Tread Flex $2,195 Tread Vision $3,495 Tread+ Vision $6,695 Bike+ $2,695 Bike $1,695 Row+ $3,495 Save today to ride, run, or row Go from cardio to Pilates, strength training, and more. Tread Flex Whatever you’re feeling, there’s an expert instructor who lives for it. From running and cycling to strength, yoga, and more, every class is built around a community that shows up together.¹ Class is always in session Some days you know exactly what you need. Other days you discover it. Choose from over 10,000 classes across more than 15 workout types and find one that moves you. Move with millions of Members by your side ² “It’s been such a journey learning to respect myself, be consistent, and be my own cheerleader.” Jocelyn from Union, NJ Includes a 12-month Limited Warranty, a 3-year Belt & Motor Guarantee, and a 5-year Frame Guarantee for Treads. If it’s not for you, we’ll pick it up and refund your order, excluding the return fee. Terms apply.⁵ Peloton Apparel Style that moves you Look and train your best with instructor-approved styles, performance fabrics, and exclusive collabs. The new Peloton Commercial Series is here. Keep your streak alive, or try it for the first time with workouts that travel with you.",
    person: null,
