    logo: "/logos/hopper.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Hopper has ranked as #1 travel app in over 70 countries! We aspire to be the world’s best — and most fun — place to book travel. OUR OFFERING We're global Hopper is an accredited travel agency. We partner with airlines , hotels , homes , and car rental providers across the globe so you can feel confident you’re booking the perfect vacation at the best price. IN GOOD COMPANY Backed by some of the world’s leading investors Hopper sells billions of dollars of travel every year. We’ve raised over $750 million of private capital and are backed by some of the world's largest institutional investors and banks. We’re able to make the most accurate price predictions because our algorithms process and archive trillions of data points. Every day, Hopper analyzes over 30 billion price points in real-time so you’ll never miss a deal. Every time you book with Hopper, we plant 2 trees for free on your behalf to help offset the carbon footprint of your travel as part of our Hopper Trees program. Join our team We’re a fully remote company with team members all around the world. We’re hiring!",
