    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Research Blog Domains Data Join us Contact Menu Close Research Blog Domains Data Join us Contact .p26-page h1,.p26-page h2,.p26-page h3,.p26-page h4{text-wrap:balance}.p26-nobr{white-space:nowrap}@media (min-width:768px){.p26-pp-nw{display: Our mission is to deeply understand model failures. Not the cases where a model gets the answer wrong, but the ones where it technically finishes the task and does something no one wanted along the way. Tests rarely catch this type of failu Patronus AI was founded in 2023 by Anand Kannappan and Rebecca Qian. Our researchers and engineers come from Meta Superintelligence Labs, Amazon AGI, Apple and Google. “Reliability for AI agents will require the equivalent of ‘five nines’ for software systems. The path to getting there runs directly through simulation.” “The next frontier of AI depends on scalable simulation and trustworthy evaluation. We’re building the infrastructure to make that possible.”"}],
