    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Send and receive packages with Swapbox # Receive packages with Swapbox # Prevent missed deliveries with Swapbox. We give you control over your packages — no more missed delivery notices or stolen packages. Shop online and ship packages to a Swapbox. We'll notify you via email and/or text message with the pickup details when they arrive. Learn more: swapbox.com/faq Receiving deliveries video: https://vimeo.com/76379214 # Send packages with Swapbox # Take anything that you want to ship to your local Swapbox, no planning ahead necessary. Enter a few details about where your item is being shipped and how fast you want it there. Place your item in the Swapbox (It doesn't even need to be packaged!\nBatch: Winter 2013. Status: Inactive. Industry: Consumer. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
