    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "DirectShifts helps telehealth and digital health companies build, launch, and scale nationwide clinical workforces. We provide the workforce and operational infrastructure needed to expand into new states—from recruiting physicians, nurse practitioners, physician assistants, nurses, and other clinicians to managing multi-state licensing, credentialing, payer enrollment, collaborative physician supervision, telehealth scheduling, and ongoing workforce operations. For companies expanding nationally, we help clinicians obtain and maintain licenses across multiple states, manage Medicare, Medicaid, and commercial payer enrollment, and provide collaborative physician and supervision solutions for\nBatch: Summer 2019. Status: Active. Industry: Healthcare. Location: New York City, NY, USA; Remote"}],
