    stage: "Early",
    round: null,
    summary: "Arpeggio Bio develops drugs targeting transcription factors using AI…",
    person: null,
    funder: "Y Combinator",
    source: "Y Combinator",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/arpeggio-bio",
    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Arpeggio Bio is a pioneering pharmaceutical company that develops drugs targeting transcription factors using AI and high-throughput RNA-sequencing. With $20M in venture funding, we've targeted \"undruggable\" proteins like NRF2, TEAD, and GPX4 where our lead program is rapidly progressing towards a DC for the treatment of IO-resistant melanoma. With partnerships with J&J and FORMA, we've validated our platform in rare disease and inflammation with a significant Phase I success.\nBatch: Summer 2019. Status: Active. Industry: Healthcare. Location: Boulder, CO, USA"}],
