    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Alder is an AI employee that owns order-to-cash, from invoice to cash in the bank. You hire it the way you'd hire someone for your AR team, and it does the work your team never gets to. Most late B2B invoices aren't refusals. They're stuck behind a stalled approval, a portal rejection, a missing PO number or an AP contact who left. Alder finds out why each invoice is late and clears the blocker. It submits and resubmits invoices in Coupa and SAP Ariba, calls AP teams, tracks promises to pay, works disputes and matches payments. Every action is logged in your ERP, and customer-facing steps wait for your approval. Your team stops chasing paper and spends its time on the accounts that need judg\nBatch: Fall 2025. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
