    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Agnost AI monitors AI agents in production: chat agents, voice agents, copilots and MCP servers. It reads every conversation and OpenTelemetry trace, groups them by user and session, and catches what dashboards miss: wrong answers that look like success, frustrated users, broken tool calls. Teams write evals/checks in plain language; Agnost judges every production conversation and alerts in Slack. When something fails, Auto Improve opens a pull request with a fix tested against past runs. Works with all agents framework. For high-volume workflows, we also fine-tune specialized models on a customer's own traces.\nBatch: Summer 2026. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
