    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Taan builds foundation music models that do what you tell them to, when you tell them to. We're starting with music for video. Give Taan a video and it watches it, then composes an original score that follows the emotion and timing of every cut. If the scene is tense for 10 seconds and then turns happy, the music changes at that exact moment. You get back a fully mixed .mp4. Agents and apps call Taan through our API, so any video tool can add scored, synced music with one call. Today's music models can make catchy tracks, but you can't steer them. Ask for \"violin at exactly the 11th second\" and they usually skip it. We trained Taan from the ground up for control. We measured Taan on prompt a\nBatch: Fall 2026. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
