    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Armorer helps companies in regulated industries ship their own AI systems faster and keep them secure in production. Most security tools flag an issue and file a ticket. Armorer assesses your agent and simulates attacks to find the real issues. Then it creates a verified fix that stops the attack without breaking the business, ready for your approval in about 4 hours. In production, Armorer checks every agent action in milliseconds, with no GPU needed. It detects malicious behavior such as prompt injection, goal hijacking and data leaks, then allows, holds or denies the action. Armorer's detection models beat every other detector we tested on six public benchmarks. Armorer is 22% more accura\nBatch: Fall 2026. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
