    sourceUrl: "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/truemile",
    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "TrueMile is a trucking company run by AI agents. Drivers who own their trucks join our company and earn 30% more profit, while agents run our back office so one person can now manage 9x the amount of trucks. Companies that ship goods don't sign contracts with one-truck businesses. So these drivers contact brokers one by one, taking jobs as they become available. That's the trap. A job that looks great can strand you in a city where the next jobs pay less. Our AI negotiates brokers across 10 markets at once to weigh profit across the whole week, not just one job at a time. Trucking is insanely hard to scale because more trucks always meant hiring more people. Now we're finally able to scale t\nBatch: Fall 2026. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
