    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Papaya is the optimization engine for AI agents. Engineers don’t have time to keep improving the agents they’ve shipped. Context bloat, chatty subagents, and broken tool calls sit in production traces nobody reads, so no one can tell whether the agent is delivering the outcome it was built for. Papaya analyzes production traces and code, groups runs by business use case, and measures each one against its intended business outcome. Over 200 research-backed analyses find what’s holding the agent back. Every fix is ranked by impact on quality, latency, and cost, and the ones engineers approve ship as pull requests. Customers typically see a 20%+ quality improvement from the first analysis.\nBatch: Fall 2026. Status: Active. Industry: B2B. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
