    files: [{"title": "Y Combinator", "text": "Vibe Robotics builds robots for the work nobody should have to repeat. We’re starting in hotels. Every day, housekeeping teams move linens between floors, restock carts, and fold stacks of laundry before the next guests arrive. It’s physical work that has to get done every shift. Our first robot, Vibe 01, folds a hand towel fully autonomously in 23.8 seconds. It learned from just a few hundred human demonstrations. We’re piloting Vibe 01 at a Hilton property and working with hotels under the Marriott, Hilton, and IHG brands to bring it to more locations. Folding is the first job. Next are restocking housekeeping carts and moving linens between floors. We’re Archer, Daniel, Katherine, and Pra\nBatch: Winter 2027. Status: Active. Industry: Industrials. Location: San Francisco, CA, USA"}],
